# Backend (FastAPI + PostgreSQL)
### Features:

JWT authentication with HTTP-only cookies
Role-based access control (Admin, Lecturer, Student)
PostgreSQL database with SQLAlchemy ORM
RESTful API endpoints for users, tasks, and authentication
Password hashing with bcrypt
Automatic admin user creation (username: admin, password: admin123)

### User Roles:

- Admin: Full system access
- Lecturer: Can create tasks, manage students, view all tasks they created
- Student: Can view assigned tasks, see colleagues

## Frontend (React + Tailwind)
Color Scheme: Black, Orange, White, and Sky Blue

Pages:

Login Page: Clean authentication interface
Dashboard: Statistics cards showing task counts
Profile: Update email/name and change password

Tasks:
Lecturers: Create, edit, delete, assign tasks to students
Students: View assigned tasks


Students/Colleagues:
Lecturers: Add and manage students
Students: View fellow students



## Setup Instructions:


## FOR BACKEND SETUP

cd task_api

### Install Python dependencies
`pipenv install fastapi uvicorn sqlalchemy psycopg2-binary python-jose[cryptography] passlib[bcrypt] python-multipart`

`pipenv shell` to activate the virtual environment

## To create Lecturer User
`python app.create_lecturer`

### Run backend server
`python app.main`

Server runs on http://localhost:8000




## FOR THE FRONTEND SETUP

### Create React app
`npx create-react-app task_client`

cd task_client

## Install Tailwind CSS

`npm install -D tailwindcss@3`
`npx tailwindcss init`


## Install dependencies
`npm install lucide-react`


## Update API_URL in the code if needed
## const API_URL = 'http://localhost:8000/api';

## Run frontend
Run your build process with `npm run start` or `serve -s build`

## Frontend runs on http://localhost:3000


## Database:
## sql-- Create PostgreSQL database
`CREATE DATABASE taskmanagement;`